        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition we provide a range of logistic services in North America, including inland freight, cross-docking, cold storage and warehousing services in an effort to further leverage our supply chain network within the region and optimize the productivity of our assets.",
        "start_character": 20684,
        "end_character": 20953
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001047340-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001047340-26-000015-04b646e88d448bcb",
        "accession_number": "0001047340-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the Middle East, we own or lease approximately 241 trucks used to deliver fresh produce, prepared food, and poultry products to customers.",
        "start_character": 24128,
        "end_character": 24269
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001047340-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001047340-26-000015-04b646e88d448bcb",
        "accession_number": "0001047340-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are able to maintain the high quality of our products by growing a substantial portion of our own produce and working closely with our independent growers.",
        "start_character": 34339,
        "end_character": 34497
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001047340-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001047340-26-000015-04b646e88d448bcb",
        "accession_number": "0001047340-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect to continue investing in new product development to increase revenue and maintain market leadership in our prepared foods category.",
        "start_character": 15396,
        "end_character": 15537
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001047340-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001047340-26-000015-04b646e88d448bcb",
        "accession_number": "0001047340-26-000015",
